  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your maximum spell power is “more than maximum.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Maximize Spell<sup>CRB</sup>, 7th mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a spell augmented with Maximize Spell, all variable, numeric effects of the spell are treated as 150% of their maximum.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend two uses of mythic power to cast a spell as a maximized spell (gaining only the normal benefits of a maximized spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as maximized in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> All variable, numeric effects of a maximized spell are automatically at their highest value.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
